LANDTAKER BRAND ASSET LICENSE

The assets in this directory are the exclusive property of the Landtaker
project and its contributors. They are NOT covered by the AGPL v3.0 that
applies to the source code, nor by the Creative Commons BY-SA 4.0 licence
that applies to the assets in resources/.

They are also entirely separate from proprietary/, which contains assets
belonging to OpenFront Inc. Nothing in this directory is derived from, or
grants any rights to, those assets.

WHAT IS IN HERE:
Original brand and identity assets created for Landtaker — logos, wordmarks,
rank insignia, and other artwork that identifies the project.

PERMITTED USE:
- You may use these assets for development, testing, and contribution
  purposes to Landtaker
- You may use these assets solely as part of the complete Landtaker software
  package
- You may view and study these assets for personal educational purposes
- You may run, compile, and test the software containing these assets

RESTRICTIONS:
You may NOT:
- Extract, copy, or use these assets in any other project or work
- Modify, alter, or create derivative works of these assets for redistribution
- Redistribute, sublicense, sell, or transfer these assets separately from
  Landtaker
- Use these assets for any commercial purpose outside of running Landtaker
- Use these assets in a way that implies endorsement by, or affiliation with,
  the Landtaker project

WHY THIS EXISTS:
The source code is released under the AGPL and must stay that way. Brand
identity is different: a fork is free to take the code, but it must not ship
under our name and marks. Keeping these assets under a separate licence is
what makes that distinction enforceable.

If you fork Landtaker, replace the contents of this directory with your own
brand assets.
